            </note>
            <note corresp="#d18-f3" n="3" xml:id="d18-f3-content">
                <p> Carter wrote in the left margin: “Sounds accurate for us.”</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d18-f4" n="4" xml:id="d18-f4-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d19">Document 19</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d18-f5" n="5" xml:id="d18-f5-content">
                <p> Carter underlined the phrase “Sol Linowitz go talk to them” and wrote in the
                    left margin: “Let me have Sol’s report first.”</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
